    <entry>
      <title>文章标题</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/11/%E8%8C%A7%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%BA_1.0/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/11/%E8%8C%A7%E4%B8%AD%E4%BA%BA_1.0/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="茧中人-1-0"><a href="#茧中人-1-0" class="headerlink" title="茧中人_1.0"></a>茧中人_1.0</h1><p>前言：创宇杯安卓逆向的一道题目，最近实战没有思路，所以来<code>CTF</code>找找灵感，想把基础补一下。比赛的那天学校调休满课，然后没打，看别人说挺有意思的，然后来做一下，还有一个<code>WebPortal_1.0</code>后面有时间再做一下，其他的好像都是动态环境，就没下载了。说实话已经很久没有体会过逆向的快乐了，平时比赛都是<code>ai</code>一把梭，这次主要是给<code>ai</code>提供思路，让它给我写脚本。</p><blockquote><p>相关函数解释：</p><p><code>AAssetManager_open</code>：用于从 <code>C/C++</code>代码中打开<code>assets</code>目录下的文件</p><p><code>getFilesDir()</code>：返回应用在内部存储空间中的专属文件目录</p><p><code>RegisterNatives</code>：动态注册方法，关键数据结构<code>JNINativeMethod</code></p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">typedef struct &#123;    const char* name;      &#x2F;&#x2F; Java 层的方法名（如 &quot;encrypt&quot;）    const char* signature; &#x2F;&#x2F; 方法签名（如 &quot;(Ljava&#x2F;lang&#x2F;String;)Ljava&#x2F;lang&#x2F;String;&quot;）    void*       fnPtr;     &#x2F;&#x2F; 对应的 Native 函数指针（真正干活的函数地址）&#125; JNINativeMethod;<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre></blockquote><h2 id="1-Java层"><a href="#1-Java层" class="headerlink" title="1.Java层"></a>1.<code>Java</code>层</h2><p><code>jadx-gui</code>反编译，<code>Java</code>层代码很简单，主要逻辑在<code>so</code>层，有几个函数<code>attachBaseContext</code>,<code>onCreate</code></p><h2 id="2-so层分析"><a href="#2-so层分析" class="headerlink" title="2.so层分析"></a>2.<code>so</code>层分析</h2><h3 id="attachBaseContext分析"><a href="#attachBaseContext分析" class="headerlink" title="attachBaseContext分析"></a><code>attachBaseContext</code>分析</h3><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009194246193.png" alt="image-20261009194246193"></p><p>代码看着很乱，应该是使用了自定义虚表偏移，在<code>ida</code>中恢复<code>JNIEnv</code>类型</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009194837232.png" alt="image-20261009194837232"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009194847206.png" alt="image-20261009194847206"></p><p>代码被还原了，代码主要逻辑就是调用父类方法，获取FINGERPRINT，查找是否含有<code>generic</code>，<code>vbox</code>等关键字，进行模拟器检测</p><h3 id="onCreate分析"><a href="#onCreate分析" class="headerlink" title="onCreate分析"></a><code>onCreate</code>分析</h3><p>先用<code>D810</code>插件去一下混淆，有效果但是不多</p><p>几个关键部分：</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009204521218.png" alt="image-20261009204521218"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009204555340.png" alt="image-20261009204555340"></p><blockquote><p><code>/proc/self/status</code>用来展示当前进程的各种状态信息</p></blockquote><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009205254657.png" alt="image-20261009205254657"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261009205311288.png" alt="image-20261009205311288"></p><blockquote><p><code>hook</code>检测</p></blockquote><p>获取包名，然后从包名生成密钥</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144152192.png" alt="image-20261011144152192"></p><blockquote><p><code>key</code>依赖包名动态生成，因此修改包名会导致后续<code>DEX</code>解密失败</p></blockquote><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144439496.png" alt="image-20261011144439496"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144457288.png" alt="image-20261011144457288"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144508559.png" alt="image-20261011144508559"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144520831.png" alt="image-20261011144520831"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144536510.png" alt="image-20261011144536510"></p><p>获取当前应用签名</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011144802242.png" alt="image-20261011144802242"></p><p>将最终结果写入<code>n5381</code>，并检查，即当<code>n5381</code>既不等于-1220281383（原始<code>APK</code>签名对应的校验值）和0时，退出</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011145113956.png" alt="image-20261011145113956"></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011145124904.png" alt="image-20261011145124904"></p><p>读取<code>assets</code>文件</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011153037481.png" alt="image-20261011153037481"></p><p>解密逻辑，最后操作为循环右移两位</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011153102713.png" alt="image-20261011153102713"></p><p>然后检查文件头</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011153250870.png" alt="image-20261011153250870"></p><p>这部分其实是一个经过轻量自定义加密的<code>DEX</code>文件</p><p>往后看还有一个<code>sub_3F0C</code>函数，简单来说就是传入路径字符串拼接<code>/real.dex</code>并返回，后面就是一些删除操作。</p><p>再看一下几个<code>case</code>，中间有<code>getClassLoader</code>函数，而且还使用了<code>DexClassLoader</code>,加载类<code>com.xiaoyuyc.mobile2.CoreApplication</code></p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011160549128.png" alt="image-20261011160549128"></p><p>中间还创建了一个文件，后面又被清理了，但是只覆盖了前16字节</p><p>然后加载<code>com.xiaoyuyc.mobile2.modules.VerificationCenter</code>,调用<code>RegisterNatives</code>，包含<code>checkFlag</code>和<code>sub_3DB0</code>函数</p><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011161042168.png" alt="image-20261011161042168"></p><p><code>sub_3DB0</code>是一个校验函数，与目标数组比较，相同返回1，不同返回0</p><p>所以整体逻辑就是：父类初始化，反调试等，根据包名生成解密密钥，校验<code>APK</code>签名，从<code>assets/init_res</code>解密真实 <code>DEX</code>，<code>DexClassLoader</code>加载 <code>CoreApplication</code>，注册<code>VerificationCenter.checkFlag</code>的<code>Native</code>实现。</p><h2 id="3-解题思路"><a href="#3-解题思路" class="headerlink" title="3.解题思路"></a>3.解题思路</h2><p>从 <code>APK</code> 中提取 <code>assets/init_res</code>，按<code>native</code>解密逻辑还原<code>DEX</code>，运行<code>exp</code>还原出真正的<code>dex</code>。</p><p><code>DEX</code>解密：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">#!&#x2F;usr&#x2F;bin&#x2F;env python3import hashlibimport structimport sysimport zlibfrom pathlib import Pathdef ror8(value: int, count: int) -&gt; int:    &quot;&quot;&quot;8 位循环右移&quot;&quot;&quot;    value &amp;&#x3D; 0xFF    return ((value &gt;&gt; count) | (value &lt;&lt; (8 - count))) &amp; 0xFFdef decrypt_init_res(encrypted: bytes, package_name: str) -&gt; bytes:    &quot;&quot;&quot;    根据 native 中的解密逻辑还原 DEX。    &quot;&quot;&quot;    package_bytes &#x3D; package_name.encode(&quot;utf-8&quot;)    # 生成 16 字节循环密钥    key &#x3D; bytes(        package_bytes[i % len(package_bytes)] ^ 0x5A        for i in range(16)    )    decrypted &#x3D; bytearray(len(encrypted))    previous &#x3D; 0xAA    for i, current in enumerate(encrypted):        value &#x3D; previous ^ i ^ current ^ key[i &amp; 0x0F]        decrypted[i] &#x3D; ror8(value, 2)        # 注意：保存的是上一个密文字节        previous &#x3D; current    return bytes(decrypted)def fix_dex_checksums(data: bytes) -&gt; bytes:    &quot;&quot;&quot;    修复 DEX 的 SHA-1 和 Adler32。    &quot;&quot;&quot;    data &#x3D; bytearray(data)    if data[:4] !&#x3D; b&quot;dex\n&quot;:        raise ValueError(            &quot;解密结果不是 DEX 文件，头部为: &quot;            + data[:16].hex(&quot; &quot;)        )    if len(data) &lt; 0x70:        raise ValueError(&quot;DEX 文件长度异常&quot;)    # SHA-1 覆盖 offset 0x20 到文件末尾    sha1_digest &#x3D; hashlib.sha1(data[32:]).digest()    data[12:32] &#x3D; sha1_digest    # Adler32 覆盖 offset 0x0C 到文件末尾    adler32_value &#x3D; zlib.adler32(data[12:]) &amp; 0xFFFFFFFF    struct.pack_into(&quot;&lt;I&quot;, data, 8, adler32_value)    return bytes(data)def main():    if len(sys.argv) !&#x3D; 4:        print(            &quot;用法:\n&quot;            f&quot;  &#123;sys.argv[0]&#125; &lt;加密文件&gt; &lt;包名&gt; &lt;输出dex&gt;\n\n&quot;            &quot;示例:\n&quot;            f&quot;  &#123;sys.argv[0]&#125; assets&#x2F;init_res &quot;            &quot;com.xiaoyuyc.mobile2 real.dex&quot;        )        sys.exit(1)    input_file &#x3D; Path(sys.argv[1])    package_name &#x3D; sys.argv[2]    output_file &#x3D; Path(sys.argv[3])    if not input_file.is_file():        print(f&quot;错误：文件不存在: &#123;input_file&#125;&quot;)        sys.exit(1)    encrypted &#x3D; input_file.read_bytes()    try:        decrypted &#x3D; decrypt_init_res(encrypted, package_name)        if not decrypted.startswith(b&quot;dex\n&quot;):            print(&quot;解密失败：输出不是 DEX&quot;)            print(&quot;输出头部:&quot;, decrypted[:16].hex(&quot; &quot;))            sys.exit(2)        fixed_dex &#x3D; fix_dex_checksums(decrypted)        output_file.write_bytes(fixed_dex)    except Exception as exc:        print(f&quot;处理失败: &#123;exc&#125;&quot;)        sys.exit(2)    print(f&quot;解密成功: &#123;output_file&#125;&quot;)    print(f&quot;文件大小: &#123;len(fixed_dex)&#125; bytes&quot;)    print(f&quot;DEX magic: &#123;fixed_dex[:8]!r&#125;&quot;)if __name__ &#x3D;&#x3D; &quot;__main__&quot;:    main()<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p><img src="D:\A\Document\png\image-20261011165838162.png" alt="image-20261011165838162"></p><p><code>sub_3DB0</code>是关键函数，<code>CIPHER_BLOCK</code> 转成无符号字节，要求<code>n5381</code>&#x3D;&#x3D; -1220281383,检测时只使用低八位</p><p><code>exp</code>:</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">def rol8(value, count):    return ((value &lt;&lt; count) | (value &gt;&gt; (8 - count))) &amp; 0xffcipher &#x3D; [    0xC9, 0x88, 0x65, 0x91, 0xCB, 0xB3, 0x08, 0x50,    0xA9, 0x21, 0x88, 0x90, 0x39, 0x5A, 0x6D, 0x17,    0x59, 0xAE, 0xF4, 0xC5, 0x61, 0xD7, 0x86, 0x44,    0x51, 0x5C]state &#x3D; 0x5Aresult &#x3D; []for i, target in enumerate(cipher):    for ch in range(0x20, 0x7F):        value &#x3D; (rol8(state ^ ch, 3) + 3 * i) &amp; 0xFF        if value &#x3D;&#x3D; target:            result.append(chr(ch))            state &#x3D; value            breakprint(&quot;&quot;.join(result))<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>输出</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">cyctf_mobile2_2026year_yes<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>所以<code>flag</code>为</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">flag&#123;cyctf_mobile2_2026year_yes&#125;<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
