      <title>记一次脱壳实战</title>
      <link href="/2026/09/27/%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%84%B1%E5%A3%B3%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/"/>
      <url>/2026/09/27/%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%84%B1%E5%A3%B3%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>前言:最近开始尝试一些实战了，想多总结一下<code>app</code>逆向的思路,毕竟其他的一些分析可以依靠<code>ai</code>来完成，这也是我第一次脱企业壳，<code>app</code>的版本也比较老</p></blockquote><h1 id="一-环境准备"><a href="#一-环境准备" class="headerlink" title="一.环境准备"></a>一.环境准备</h1><p>软件：某江文学城</p><p>包名：<code>com.jjwxc.reader</code>，使用 360 加固。</p><p>使用工具：<code>Frida 16.7.19</code>，小米 6（ARM 真机，Android 9），<code>frida-dexdump</code>，<code>deepseek</code>网页版，<code>dsh+v4flash</code>，<code>backsmali</code></p><h1 id="二-脱壳工作"><a href="#二-脱壳工作" class="headerlink" title="二.脱壳工作"></a>二.脱壳工作</h1><p>先尝试能不能用工具直接脱壳</p><p>把软件安装到<code>x86</code>模拟器，然后启动<code>frida</code>，但是发现<code>frida</code>会闪退，原因是 <code>libjiagu.so</code> 只有 ARM 版本，需要 <code>libhoudini.so</code> 翻译，加固壳在翻译层中触发自毁。于是切换到真机，<code>spawn</code>模式注入仍会因反调试崩溃。</p><p>调整策略使用<code>attach</code>模式，等<code>app</code>稳定之后再附加<code>frida</code></p><p>查 <code>PID</code> 并附加：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">adb shell pidof com.jjwxc.readerfrida-dexdump -U -p &lt;PID&gt; -d --sleep 10<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>成功<code>dump</code>出14个<code>DEX</code>文件</p><p>用<code>jadx-gui</code>打开最大的 <code>classes07.dex</code>，产生报错<code>Bad dex file checksum</code>，说明<code>dex</code>文件头部有损坏，使用 010 Editor 的<code>DexFixer.1sc</code>脚本一键修复，再打开发现没有报错了，且内部逻辑已经恢复。</p><blockquote><p>其实到这一步我不知道算不算脱壳成功了，所以就往后在尝试一下重新构建后的<code>app</code>能不能直接运行</p></blockquote><h1 id="三-脱壳后重建"><a href="#三-脱壳后重建" class="headerlink" title="三.脱壳后重建"></a>三.脱壳后重建</h1><h2 id="1-静态分析"><a href="#1-静态分析" class="headerlink" title="1.静态分析"></a>1.静态分析</h2><blockquote><p>分析代码的过程由<code>dsh</code>完成</p></blockquote><p>分析<code>classes07.dex</code>，查看 <code>MainActivity</code>：</p><ul><li>110 个方法中，109 个有完整 Java 实现。</li><li>被抽空的是 <code>onCreate</code>和<code>n</code>方法，声明为 <code>protected native void onCreate(Bundle)</code>，<code>code_off=0</code>，没有任何字节码。</li><li><code>static {}</code> 里只有一行：<code>StubApp.interface11(5901)</code>，其中 <code>5901 = class_def 索引 5900 + 1</code>，是 360 加固的类注册回调。</li></ul><p>继续分析发现：</p><p><code>p()</code> 是真正的 <code>initView</code>：</p><ul><li>16 次 <code>findViewById</code>（<code>shelf_rl</code>、<code>bookstore_rl</code>、<code>forum_rl</code>、<code>shelf_tv</code> 等）</li><li>8 次 <code>setOnClickListener</code></li><li>创建广播接收者 <code>MainActivity$22</code></li><li>调用 <code>a()</code></li></ul><p>全 DEX 交叉引用扫描确认：<code>p()</code> 没有任何 Java 调用者，只能由 native <code>onCreate</code> 通过 <code>JNI </code>回调。</p><h2 id="2-动态分析onCreate函数"><a href="#2-动态分析onCreate函数" class="headerlink" title="2.动态分析onCreate函数"></a>2.动态分析<code>onCreate</code>函数</h2><p>用<code>Frida</code> 在 <code>android.app.Activity.setContentView(int)</code> 上做了全局 hook，并在 <code>p()/q()/j()/f()/k()/l()/h()/a()</code> 等方法的实现里打印调用栈，从栈帧中的 <code>MainActivity.onCreate(Native Method)</code> 反推 native 侧的回调顺序。 注意全局 hook 会命中所有 Activity，必须按调用栈区分归属：本次捕获到的 <code>2130903152</code> 是 <code>0x7f030070</code>＝<code>layout/activity_guesslike</code>（属于 <code>GuessLike_Act</code>），不是<code>MainActivity</code> 的布局；<code>MainActivity</code> 的是 <code>0x7f030077</code>＝<code>layout/activity_main</code>。</p><p><code>onResume</code> 里调 <code>n()</code>；<code>onClick</code> 里调 <code>a(1)</code>&#x2F;<code>a(2)</code> 切换 Tab 后调 <code>n()</code>。脚本如下：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-javascript" data-language="javascript"><code class="language-javascript">console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] Script loaded, starting anti-debug hooks..."</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token comment">// ---------- 1. 绕过 ptrace 反调试 ----------</span><span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    <span class="token keyword">var</span> ptrace <span class="token operator">=</span> Module<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">findExportByName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">null</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"ptrace"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>ptrace<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        Interceptor<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">replace</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>ptrace<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token keyword">new</span> <span class="token class-name">NativeCallback</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">request<span class="token punctuation">,</span> pid<span class="token punctuation">,</span> addr<span class="token punctuation">,</span> data</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] ptrace("</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> request <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">") intercepted, returning 0"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'pointer'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[+] ptrace hooked"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[-] ptrace hook failed: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token comment">// ---------- 2. 绕过 exit 主动退出 ----------</span><span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    <span class="token keyword">var</span> exit <span class="token operator">=</span> Module<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">findExportByName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">null</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"exit"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>exit<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        Interceptor<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">replace</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>exit<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token keyword">new</span> <span class="token class-name">NativeCallback</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">status</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] exit("</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> status <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">") intercepted, blocked"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'void'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[+] exit hooked"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[-] exit hook failed: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token comment">// ---------- 3. 绕过 Java 层调试检测 ----------</span>Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">perform</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    <span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        <span class="token keyword">var</span> Debug <span class="token operator">=</span> Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">use</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'android.os.Debug'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        Debug<span class="token punctuation">.</span>isDebuggerConnected<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function-variable function">implementation</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] isDebuggerConnected() called, returning false"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token boolean">false</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[+] Debug.isDebuggerConnected hooked"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[-] Debug hook failed: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token comment">// ---------- 4. 延迟观测 MainActivity ----------</span><span class="token comment">// 360 壳会在启动后一段时间才把业务 DEX 加载进来</span><span class="token comment">// 延迟 10 秒，避开启动初期的反调试高峰，等类加载完成</span><span class="token keyword">var</span> <span class="token constant">DELAY_MS</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">10000</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token function">setTimeout</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] Delay finished, trying to hook MainActivity..."</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">perform</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        <span class="token keyword">var</span> MainActivity<span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            MainActivity <span class="token operator">=</span> Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">use</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'com.example.jinjiangshucheng.ui.MainActivity'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[+] MainActivity found!"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[-] MainActivity not found: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token keyword">return</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span>        <span class="token comment">// 要观测的方法列表（根据你的分析报告）</span>        <span class="token keyword">var</span> methods <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">'p'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'f'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'q'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'g'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'h'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'j'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'k'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'l'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'m'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'a'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'onClick'</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">'n'</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        methods<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">methodName</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>            <span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                <span class="token keyword">var</span> overloads <span class="token operator">=</span> MainActivity<span class="token punctuation">[</span>methodName<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>overloads<span class="token punctuation">;</span>                overloads<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">forEach</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">overload</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                    overload<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function-variable function">implementation</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                        <span class="token keyword">var</span> argsStr <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">""</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                            argsStr <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token constant">JSON</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">stringify</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token class-name">Array</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>prototype<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">slice</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">call</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>arguments<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                            argsStr <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">"[unserializable]"</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span>                        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"\n[CALL] MainActivity."</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> methodName <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">"("</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> argsStr <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">")"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token comment">// 打印调用栈，定位 native onCreate 的回调时机</span>                        <span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                            <span class="token keyword">var</span> stack <span class="token operator">=</span> Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">use</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'android.util.Log'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getStackTraceString</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>                                Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">use</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'java.lang.Exception'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>$<span class="token keyword">new</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>                            <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[STACK] "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> stack<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                            console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[STACK] failed: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span>                        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token function">overload</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">apply</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> arguments<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>                console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[+] Hooked: "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> methodName<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>e<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>                console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[-] Failed to hook "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> methodName <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">": "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> e<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>            <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span>        <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"[*] All hooks installed, waiting for calls..."</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token constant">DELAY_MS</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">perform</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>    <span class="token keyword">var</span> Activity <span class="token operator">=</span> Java<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">use</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'android.app.Activity'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    Activity<span class="token punctuation">.</span>setContentView<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">overload</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'int'</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function-variable function">implementation</span> <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token parameter">id</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">&#123;</span>        console<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">'[*] setContentView id='</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> id<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>        <span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">setContentView</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>id<span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span>    <span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="3-修改smali代码并重建"><a href="#3-修改smali代码并重建" class="headerlink" title="3.修改smali代码并重建"></a>3.修改<code>smali</code>代码并重建</h2><p>使用<code>backsmali.jar</code>反编译<code>dex</code>文件，把</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">.method protected native onCreate(Landroid&#x2F;os&#x2F;Bundle;)V.end method<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>替换为：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-none"><code class="language-none">.method protected onCreate(Landroid&#x2F;os&#x2F;Bundle;)V    .registers 3    invoke-super &#123;p0, p1&#125;, Landroid&#x2F;support&#x2F;v4&#x2F;app&#x2F;FragmentActivity;-&gt;onCreate(Landroid&#x2F;os&#x2F;Bundle;)V    const v0, 0x7f030077                 # layout&#x2F;activity_main    invoke-virtual &#123;p0, v0&#125;, Landroid&#x2F;support&#x2F;v4&#x2F;app&#x2F;FragmentActivity;-&gt;setContentView(I)V    # 原本在 native onCreate 里赋值；a(I) 每次切 Tab 都直接用它做 beginTransaction()    invoke-virtual &#123;p0&#125;, Landroid&#x2F;support&#x2F;v4&#x2F;app&#x2F;FragmentActivity;-&gt;getSupportFragmentManager()Landroid&#x2F;support&#x2F;v4&#x2F;app&#x2F;FragmentManager;    move-result-object v0    iput-object v0, p0, Lcom&#x2F;example&#x2F;jinjiangshucheng&#x2F;ui&#x2F;MainActivity;-&gt;fragmentManager:Landroid&#x2F;support&#x2F;v4&#x2F;app&#x2F;FragmentManager;    invoke-direct &#123;p0&#125;, Lcom&#x2F;example&#x2F;jinjiangshucheng&#x2F;ui&#x2F;MainActivity;-&gt;p()V    const&#x2F;4 v0, 0x0    invoke-direct &#123;p0, v0&#125;, Lcom&#x2F;example&#x2F;jinjiangshucheng&#x2F;ui&#x2F;MainActivity;-&gt;a(I)V    return-void.end method<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>并清理所有<code>StubApp</code>引用，最后重新打包，出现了闪退</p><h2 id="4-后续"><a href="#4-后续" class="headerlink" title="4.后续"></a>4.后续</h2><p>然后就一直让<code>dsh</code>解决闪退的问题，最后也有点疲惫了，就没有再去补了，补到最后的效果就是：进主页、切三个 tab、进个人中心、书架有真实书目、书城子 tab，但是点击搜索书名会闪退。</p>]]></content>
      
      
